@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Calidad - Senales de calidad estatica y arquitectonica

component "Reglas de modulos Spring Modulith\npackage-info.java allowedDependencies" as ModuleRules EZ_BACKEND
component "ModulithStructureTest\nApplicationModules.verify()" as ModulithTest EZ_BACKEND
component "Maven verify in CI" as MavenVerify EZ_DEVOPS
component "Configuracion del compilador TypeScript\ntsconfig.json" as TsConfig EZ_FRONTEND
component "Script de lint Next\npackage.json: next lint" as NextLint EZ_FRONTEND
component "Ejecucion CI frontend\nno presente" as FrontendCiGap EZ_RISK
component "No se encontro Sonar/Checkstyle/SpotBugs" as StaticGap EZ_RISK

ModuleRules --> ModulithTest : verifica grafo de dependencias
ModulithTest --> MavenVerify : ejecutado en la fase test
TsConfig ..> NextLint : herramientas locales de calidad disponibles
NextLint ..> FrontendCiGap : script declarado, pero no en el flujo de trabajo
StaticGap ..> MavenVerify : no dedicated static analysis step

note bottom
Evidencia: backend package-info.java files, ModulithStructureTest.java,
frontend/package.json, frontend/tsconfig.json y flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions.
end note

@enduml
